  "description": "Compare two actually identical complete units at their real phase displacement, then back-project the existing named queryC[28, 1] by one true period to the orange second unit or two periods to the blue first unit. Inspect membership on the actual contour rather than in the interior of a pulse. Blue and orange are two instance references; red is the named point to check. None is declared a verified continued point, and colors introduce no metric or equality condition.",
